			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "bf"
		},
		{
			"expression": "confused",
			"text": "I'm confused as hell right now...",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "bf"
		},
		{
			"expression": "concerned",
			"text": "Oh? Hm.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "confused",
			"text": "So how did that transformation thing happen?",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "bf"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "I'm only gonna tell you but only if you promise to keep this a secret.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "confused",
			"text": "Ok, go on.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "bf"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "There was this other realm that was basically like yours, but different.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "The grass was darker, the sky was darkish green, basically very grim and dry.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "We didn't mind it but disaster struck when this \"being\" came into place.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "The Army tried to defend everyone, but it tore threw that and corrupted a few people, including me.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "It was that infectious that everyone thought I was gonna eat them up. ",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "Luckily for them however, the \"being\" somehow teleported the people who got infected here, in these woods and lies within underground...",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "worried",
			"text": "Just waiting to strike...",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "confused",
			"text": "Oh shit, why can't I alert everyone?",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "bf"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "Because, you'll wake it up...",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "confused",
			"text": "Oh, hm.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "bf"
		},
		{
			"expression": "confused",
			"text": "I wonder if it's possible to see what this \"being\" looks like.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "bf"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "Well from what I've heard, you'd have to go ask the angle known as \"Beauty\" to get you inside the cave.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "wanred",
			"text": "There's no way to dig that far underground...",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "concerned",
			"text": "Plus, why would you wanna see something that will get you killed?",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
		},
		{
			"expression": "confused",
			"text": "I feel like I can do what I done with my singing and just straight up kill the thing.",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "bf"
		},
		{
			"expression": "concerned",
			"text": "It's worth a shot...",
			"boxState": "normal",
			"sound": "",
			"speed": 0.05,
			"portrait": "radical"
